{"id": "sfusd-early-kindergarten-size-and-staffing", "title": "One early kindergarten enrollment triggered a $66,283 audit finding", "seconds": 42.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "7e5372ab8d8a8432", "words": 133, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In transitional kindergarten, one early enrollee changed which rules a classroom had to follow.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.71, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Age-eligible", "24 pupils"], ["Early enrollment", "20 pupils"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.64, 1.53, 1.81, 2.08, 2.48, 2.98, 3.18, 3.4, 3.46, 3.89, 4.02, 4.11]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In that fiscal year the tighter class limit was twenty.", "t0": 4.83, "t1": 7.2, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "20 pupils", "label": "Two sets of classroom rules"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.27, 0.67, 0.87, 0.98, 1.28, 1.58, 1.83, 1.95]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The staffing rule was one adult per ten pupils.", "t0": 7.32, "t1": 9.64, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "One adult per 10"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.5, 0.7, 0.86, 1.04, 1.38, 1.54, 1.75]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Auditors found one affected school in a sample of eight.", "t0": 9.86, "t1": 12.38, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "One of eight tested schools", "text": "Eight schools", "mark": "Eight"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.83, 1.03, 1.42, 1.77, 1.88, 1.94, 2.26, 2.35]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Its classroom averaged 22 pupils and two adults.", "t0": 12.5, "t1": 14.97, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Early-enrollment limit", "20 pupils"], ["Class average", "22 pupils"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.59, 0.88, 1.31, 1.7, 1.81, 1.98]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Both limits were exceeded.", "t0": 15.09, "t1": 16.25, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Both limits"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.51, 0.65]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The class-size calculation put $66,283 at issue.", "t0": 16.37, "t1": 21.4, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$66,283", "label": "Two findings in the same calculation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.72, 1.71, 2.0, 2.68, 3.21, 3.48, 3.76, 4.19, 4.55, 4.66]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The separate staffing calculation returned zero.", "t0": 21.52, "t1": 23.66, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Class size", "$66,283"], ["Staffing", "$0"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.42, 0.82, 1.39, 1.7]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The state spreadsheet rounds how many adults are needed.", "t0": 23.78, "t1": 26.12, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "Two findings in the same calculation", "text": "State spreadsheet", "mark": "State"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.41, 0.97, 1.24, 1.38, 1.56, 1.85, 1.98]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "That rounding explains why the staffing finding had no extra dollar charge.", "t0": 26.24, "t1": 29.9, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Staffing penalty"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.61, 1.06, 1.22, 1.33, 1.78, 2.26, 2.47, 2.66, 2.94, 3.22]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The district said enrollment staff received training.", "t0": 30.12, "t1": 32.31, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "The district added monthly checks", "text": "Enrollment staff", "mark": "Enrollment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.5, 0.68, 1.14, 1.45, 1.77]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "It also described a new monthly check for early enrollments.", "t0": 32.43, "t1": 34.98, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "The district added monthly checks", "text": "Monthly internal audit", "mark": "Monthly"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.37, 0.74, 0.81, 0.95, 1.26, 1.52, 1.66, 1.89]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The June 2026 state aid schedule does not isolate the kindergarten penalty.", "t0": 35.1, "t1": 38.95, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Final collection"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.33, 0.6, 1.08, 1.36, 1.54, 2.02, 2.24, 2.44, 2.82, 2.91, 3.4]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 39.07, "t1": 41.22, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Two sets of classroom rules", "b": "One of eight tested schools", "o": "The district added monthly checks"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "document"}